@id: scene.chapter_37_Luminaire_Keeper
@when: Unknown.scene_chapter_37_Luminaire_Keeper
@where: Realm/Physical/Unknown
@scope: narrative

=segments:
  - line: 1
    type: narration
    text: "chapter 37: Luminaire Keeper"
  - line: 3
    type: narration
    text: "The Scorch lived up to its name at dawn."
  - line: 4
    type: narration
    text: "Heat shimmered off the dunes like liquid gold, warping the horizon into a wavering mirage."
  - line: 5
    type: narration
    text: "Sweat evaporated before it could bead, stolen by the parched air."
  - line: 6
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaires shuffled forward, cloaks pulled high against the glare, boots sinking ankle-deep in scalding sand."
  - line: 7
    type: narration
    text: "Pack-lizards snorted plumes of steam, their scaled hides darkened by dust."
  - line: 8
    type: narration
    text: "Even Zaron’s hum within Geralt’s armor felt muffled, dampened by the oppressive stillness."
  - line: 9
    type: narration
    text: "Only Oreck moved with unbroken vigilance, his chroniton-flecked gaze scanning the blinding expanse."
  - line: 10
    type: narration
    text: "He felt it first – a low-frequency tremor transmitted through the sand, a vibration felt more than heard, prickling the skin beneath his scales."
  - line: 11
    type: narration
    text: "Not the wind."
  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "Something heavier."
  - line: 13
    type: narration
    text: "Deeper."
  - line: 15
    type: narration
    text: "Midway down the strung-out column, Private Ren stumbled."
  - line: 16
    type: narration
    text: "He clutched his helmet, grimacing."
  - line: 17
    type: narration
    text: "\"Stars… my ears… ringing…\" Beside him, Corporal Vess frowned."
  - line: 18
    type: narration
    text: "\"It’s silent out here, Ren."
  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "Too silent—\" Her words cut off as the ground erupted *behind* them."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "Fountains of superheated sand geysered skyward, revealing three monstrous silhouettes clawing free."
  - line: 21
    type: narration
    text: "Dregans."
  - line: 22
    type: narration
    text: "Towering slabs of distorted muscle and scarred hide, their useless wings pinned tight against bulging backs."
  - line: 23
    type: narration
    text: "Their faces were grotesque masks of reptilian fury, eyes burning with agonized madness."
  - line: 24
    type: narration
    text: "One threw back its head, jaws distending impossibly wide."
  - line: 25
    type: narration
    text: "The air itself seemed to *congeal*, then shatter."
  - line: 26
    type: narration
    text: "A focused beam of pure sonic torment ripped forward—not sound, but a physical wave of concussive disintegration."
  - line: 27
    type: narration
    text: "It struck the rearmost pack-lizard and its guard detail."
  - line: 28
    type: narration
    text: "Flesh didn’t tear; it *crystallized*."
  - line: 29
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaires and beast alike froze mid-stride, then dissolved into clouds of glittering, crimson-stained dust that rained silently onto the sand."
  - line: 30
    type: narration
    text: "The horrific silence after the scream was deafening."
  - line: 31
    type: narration
    text: "Panic choked the Legion’s rear ranks."
  - line: 32
    type: narration
    text: "Shields flared weakly, useless against resonant annihilation."
  - line: 33
    type: narration
    text: "Giantsbane deployed."
  - line: 35
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s head snapped around."
  - line: 36
    type: narration
    text: "The distant cloud of settling dust registered instantly—an attack vector slicing through his vulnerable rear."
  - line: 37
    type: narration
    text: "\"Mika!"
  - line: 38
    type: narration
    text: "Hold the front!\" His roar cut through the rising chaos."
  - line: 39
    type: narration
    text: "Dragonmail plates flared with sudden, searing azure light as Zaron’s spirit surged, responding to imminent threat."
  - line: 40
    type: narration
    text: "Time seemed to warp; Geralt blurred forward, not running, but *flowing* impossibly fast across the dunes, sand kicking up in crystalline arcs behind him."
  - line: 41
    type: narration
    text: "He passed Oreck, already reversing course with terrifying speed, the green arrows along his greaves blazing like emerald beacons pointing *back*."
  - line: 42
    type: narration
    text: "Together, they closed the distance in heartbeats, arriving as a second Dragan drew breath to scream."
  - line: 44
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt didn't hesitate."
  - line: 45
    type: narration
    text: "He *leaped*, armored form crashing onto the Dragan’s broad back like a meteor."
  - line: 46
    type: narration
    text: "His gauntleted fist, wreathed in crackling temporal energy, slammed down *not* onto bone, but onto the thick cartilage ridge at the base of its skull—a critical resonator node."
  - line: 47
    type: narration
    text: "The impact pulsed visibly, a ripple of distorted air."
  - line: 48
    type: narration
    text: "The Dragan’s scream choked into a wet, gurgling gasp."
  - line: 49
    type: narration
    text: "Its sonic blast misfired internally; blood and ruptured organs sprayed from its jaws."
  - line: 50
    type: narration
    text: "Simultaneously, Oreck lunged low."
  - line: 51
    type: narration
    text: "His cleaver wasn’t aimed to kill, but to *disable*."
  - line: 52
    type: narration
    text: "The obsidian edge, humming with chroniton green, sliced precisely through the thick tendon anchoring a third Dragan’s colossal leg to its hip."
  - line: 53
    type: narration
    text: "The creature bellowed in agony, crashing sideways, its next scream lost in a roar of primal pain and frustration."
  - line: 54
    type: narration
    text: "The immediate threat stalled, but the peril was far from over."
  - line: 55
    type: narration
    text: "The screech of southern reinforcements echoed—allied Dregans summoned by the breach."
  - line: 56
    type: narration
    text: "The Scorch drank deeper."
  - line: 58
    type: narration
    text: "The southern Dregans erupted onto the scene with terrifying silence, their larger, sand-polished hides absorbing the harsh sunlight."
  - line: 59
    type: narration
    text: "No handlers."
  - line: 60
    type: narration
    text: "No hesitation."
  - line: 61
    type: narration
    text: "The lead Dragan’s territorial challenge cry wasn’t aimed at Geralt’s forces, but at their northern kin—a wave of discordant force slamming the raging attackers sideways."
  - line: 62
    type: narration
    text: "The effect was immediate, visceral."
  - line: 63
    type: narration
    text: "The northern Dregans, consumed by genetic fury, whirled as one pack-beast, abandoning the legionnaires entirely."
  - line: 64
    type: narration
    text: "Oreck’s assessment was a low growl felt in Geralt’s bones: \"Territory.\" The ensuing clash was apocalyptic—a whirlwind of snapping spines, sonic blasts detonating prematurely, sand fused instantly into glass."
  - line: 65
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaires watched, shields trembling against debris, as giants tore each other apart."
  - line: 66
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra’s bio-scanner whirred frantically, tracking the horrifying cascade of energy signatures."
  - line: 67
    type: narration
    text: "Pragmatism, indeed."
  - line: 68
    type: narration
    text: "The victors weren’t saviors; they were conquerors clearing their hunting grounds."
  - line: 69
    type: narration
    text: "Their departure left only the groans of the dying northern Dragan Oreck crippled and the settling crimson dust of its vaporized kin."
  - line: 70
    type: narration
    text: "Silence reclaimed the desert, heavier now."
  - line: 71
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s fist lowered slowly."
  - line: 72
    type: narration
    text: "\"Regroup,\" he commanded, the word scraping raw."
  - line: 73
    type: narration
    text: "\"Secure the wounded.\" Bodies crystallized beyond the shield perimeter glittered accusingly under the merciless sun."
  - line: 74
    type: narration
    text: "Ren retched violently into the sand."
  - line: 75
    type: narration
    text: "Mika’s gaze flicked to Lyra."
  - line: 76
    type: narration
    text: "\"Stabilize Halvar *now*.\" The healer nodded, already moving, filaments pulsing urgent cyan towards the stunned veteran."
  - line: 77
    type: narration
    text: "Integration wasn't a choice anymore."
  - line: 78
    type: narration
    text: "The Scorch demanded it."
  - line: 79
    type: narration
    text: "Adapt or die."
  - line: 80
    type: narration
    text: "The deeper enemy waited, casting shadows far darker than Dragan packs."
  - line: 82
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 84
    type: narration
    text: "The air thickened, losing its knife’s edge dryness."
  - line: 85
    type: narration
    text: "Boots crunched on gravelly earth now, sand yielding to cracked hardpan radiating heat upward like coals."
  - line: 86
    type: narration
    text: "Ahead, blinding white salt flats stretched—cracked crusts whispering false promises of water under the midday glare."
  - line: 87
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s dragonmail hummed differently here; Zaron’s spirit recoiled faintly against the mineral scent carried on sudden, sluggish breezes."
  - line: 88
    type: narration
    text: "Thorny bushes clawed upward from the baking soil, razor-edged grasses scratching against scaled greaves."
  - line: 89
    type: narration
    text: "Silence draped itself like a shroud."
  - line: 90
    type: narration
    text: "No wind whispers."
  - line: 91
    type: narration
    text: "Only the scuff of weary boots and the low thrum of shield generators."
  - line: 92
    type: narration
    text: "Then, a sharp cry echoed—Corporal Vess stumbled backward from a low mound."
  - line: 93
    type: narration
    text: "Her boot sank calf-deep into liquefied clay where solid ground seemed moments before."
  - line: 94
    type: narration
    text: "The earth pulsed visibly around her leg, drawing her deeper."
  - line: 95
    type: narration
    text: "Panic flared."
  - line: 96
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaires froze."
  - line: 97
    type: narration
    text: "Oreck surged forward, his chroniton-enhanced strength anchoring him on firmer ground as he seized Vess’s arm."
  - line: 98
    type: narration
    text: "\"Don’t struggle!\" Mika barked, seeing the suction intensify."
  - line: 99
    type: narration
    text: "The clay gulped hungrily."
  - line: 100
    type: narration
    text: "\"Guide her slowly!\" Geralt ordered, scanning the treacherous basin—this was no desert."
  - line: 101
    type: narration
    text: "This was the land’s wounded throat."
  - line: 103
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 105
    type: narration
    text: "The ground betrayed them."
  - line: 106
    type: narration
    text: "Steps that felt solid crumbled into sucking mud without warning."
  - line: 107
    type: narration
    text: "Sweat plastered hair to necks, no longer evaporating but soaking into grit-stained fatigues."
  - line: 108
    type: narration
    text: "Ahead, the Breathing Pyramid rose—a scarred monument of volcanic rock and sagging sandstone, its lower half dissolving into the shimmering haze of swamp breath."
  - line: 109
    type: narration
    text: "Stagnant ponds festered; alkali rims glowed poisonous white beneath twin moons."
  - line: 110
    type: narration
    text: "Mosquitoes whined incessantly, a maddening chorus Lyra silenced near Halvar with targeted micro-pulses from her rig."
  - line: 111
    type: narration
    text: "\"Pulse… stronger here,\" Oreck rumbled, cleaver tip pointing downward."
  - line: 112
    type: narration
    text: "Beneath their feet, the faintest tremor resonated—sub-audible, felt through bone."
  - line: 113
    type: narration
    text: "The Void Spire’s dormant song."
  - line: 114
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt halted the column before the pyramid’s shadowed entrance, a collapsed archway channeling dark water inward."
  - line: 115
    type: narration
    text: "His claw traced the air before the eroded stone."
  - line: 116
    type: narration
    text: "A shimmering resonance field flickered—dry volcanic stone resisting humid decay."
  - line: 117
    type: narration
    text: "\"The threshold,\" he stated."
  - line: 118
    type: narration
    text: "His armored palm pressed against the stone."
  - line: 119
    type: narration
    text: "Scales flared bright azure."
  - line: 120
    type: narration
    text: "The stone groaned… shifted… revealing a slick descent into cloying darkness smelling of wet earth and ozone."
  - line: 121
    type: narration
    text: "The Buried Luminaire awaited."
  - line: 122
    type: narration
    text: "Its trapped lightning would be their guide… or their grave."
  - line: 123
    type: narration
    text: "Mika tightened her grip on her shock-lance."
  - line: 124
    type: narration
    text: "\"Single file."
  - line: 125
    type: narration
    text: "Shields synced."
  - line: 126
    type: narration
    text: "Watch for voids.\" The descent began."
  - line: 127
    type: narration
    text: "The stairway breathed beneath them."
  - line: 129
    type: narration
    text: "Water lapped at crumbling steps."
  - line: 130
    type: narration
    text: "Chroniton arrows on Oreck’s greaves cast jade fractals over algae-slick walls."
  - line: 131
    type: narration
    text: "Silence choked the passage—not the desert’s stillness, but the swamp’s heavy, listening quiet."
  - line: 132
    type: narration
    text: "Only the rhythmic drip of condensation pierced it."
  - line: 133
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt moved like shadow given form, Zaron’s spirit coiled taut within the armor, sensing dimensional fractures."
  - line: 134
    type: narration
    text: "A legionnaire’s boot slipped on wet stone."
  - line: 135
    type: narration
    text: "Mika’s hand snapped out, steadying him."
  - line: 136
    type: narration
    text: "\"Three seconds,\" she hissed."
  - line: 137
    type: narration
    text: "\"Scan your footing.\" Lyra’s filaments pulsed cyan, mapping the unstable geometry."
  - line: 138
    type: narration
    text: "\"Resonance spikes ahead,\" she whispered, voice tight."
  - line: 139
    type: narration
    text: "\"Micro-voids."
  - line: 140
    type: narration
    text: "Unstable.\" The corridor widened abruptly into a cavernous cistern."
  - line: 141
    type: narration
    text: "At its heart, rising from black water, stood the Void Spire—a needle of pure obsidian humming with trapped thunder."
  - line: 142
    type: narration
    text: "Above it, refracted through murk, the Buried Luminaire’s crystalline core glowed… but its light was sickly, threaded with veins of deep violet corruption."
  - line: 143
    type: narration
    text: "The Queen’s touch."
  - line: 144
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s fist clenched."
  - line: 145
    type: narration
    text: "\"Prime Keeper’s shard."
  - line: 146
    type: narration
    text: "Under siege.\" Oreck’s growl vibrated the air."
  - line: 147
    type: narration
    text: "\"Anchor point… compromised.\" The water rippled."
  - line: 148
    type: narration
    text: "Shapes coalesced in the gloom—pale, multi-limbed, drawn by the dissonant light."
  - line: 149
    type: narration
    text: "Guardians twisted."
  - line: 150
    type: narration
    text: "Or hungry things."
  - line: 152
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra’s bio-scanner hissed."
  - line: 153
    type: narration
    text: "\"Multiple bio-signatures… converging!\" Shapes slithered from flooded alcoves—pale, segmented horrors with too many jointed limbs ending in needle-claws."
  - line: 154
    type: narration
    text: "Sludge-drakes."
  - line: 155
    type: narration
    text: "Bioluminescent spores dotted their carapaces, pulsing sickly violet in sync with the corrupted Luminaire."
  - line: 156
    type: narration
    text: "They moved silently, chitin scraping wet stone."
  - line: 157
    type: narration
    text: "Jorik’s arrow flew first, a chroniton-tipped streak punching through a leading drake’s eye cluster."
  - line: 158
    type: narration
    text: "It detonated in a spray of ichor and temporal shrapnel, staggering two others."
  - line: 159
    type: narration
    text: "Oreck met the next wave head-on."
  - line: 160
    type: narration
    text: "His cleaver wasn’t a blade; it was a chroniton storm."
  - line: 161
    type: narration
    text: "Green energy sheared through chitin, triggering cascading temporal decay in the wounded."
  - line: 162
    type: narration
    text: "Flesh aged centuries in seconds, crumbling to dust."
  - line: 163
    type: narration
    text: "Mika coordinated the shield wall—legionnaires locking overlapping fields just as a drake spat a glob of acidic phlegm."
  - line: 164
    type: narration
    text: "It sizzled against the barrier, filling the air with acrid fumes."
  - line: 165
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt didn’t engage the drakes."
  - line: 166
    type: narration
    text: "He moved toward the Spire, Zaron’s spirit blazing within him."
  - line: 167
    type: narration
    text: "The dragon-armor resonated, countering the violet corruption threading the Spire’s base."
  - line: 168
    type: narration
    text: "Azure light fought violet rot."
  - line: 169
    type: narration
    text: "\"Mika!\" Geralt roared over the fray."
  - line: 170
    type: narration
    text: "\"Cover Lyra!"
  - line: 171
    type: narration
    text: "She needs access!\" Integration became combat triage."
  - line: 172
    type: narration
    text: "The healer scrambled forward, rig unfolding."
  - line: 173
    type: narration
    text: "Her target wasn't the drakes, but the Luminaire itself."
  - line: 174
    type: narration
    text: "Stabilize the anchor… or lose them all to the Queen’s hunger."
  - line: 175
    type: narration
    text: "The spire hummed louder."
  - line: 176
    type: narration
    text: "The very air crackled."
  - line: 177
    type: narration
    text: "Water rippled against Geralt's boots as he reached the Spire’s obsidian base."
  - line: 178
    type: narration
    text: "Zaron’s spectral talons manifested fully now, clawing at the violet corruption like physical rot."
  - line: 179
    type: narration
    text: "Each touch sent shivers through the stone, dislodging calcified sediment."
  - line: 180
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra slid beside him, her rig’s injectors unfolding like metallic spiders."
  - line: 181
    type: narration
    text: "\"Direct infusion required!\" she yelled, voice strained against the Spire’s rising thrum."
  - line: 182
    type: narration
    text: "\"Counter-resonance!"
  - line: 183
    type: narration
    text: "But the pattern’s chaotic!\" Geralt’s helm tilted, focusing past the battle."
  - line: 184
    type: narration
    text: "He heard it—the Luminaire’s fractured song beneath the Queen’s static."
  - line: 185
    type: narration
    text: "\"Sing it *clear*,\" he commanded Lyra."
  - line: 186
    type: narration
    text: "\"Not against the chaos."
  - line: 187
    type: narration
    text: "Through it.\" Her filaments flared cyan, syncing with Geralt’s dragon-resonance… seeking harmony in dissonance."
  - line: 188
    type: narration
    text: "The spire pulsed."
  - line: 189
    type: narration
    text: "Light flared."
  - line: 191
    type: narration
    text: "The violet veins flickered."
  - line: 192
    type: narration
    text: "Dimmed."
  - line: 193
    type: narration
    text: "For an instant, the Luminaire’s core shone pure, trapped lightning refracted through murk—a dazzling prism of sound made visible."
  - line: 194
    type: narration
    text: "Hope sparked."
  - line: 195
    type: narration
    text: "Then the Sludge-drake Alpha emerged."
  - line: 196
    type: narration
    text: "Twice the size of the others, its carapace bore scars of Anunnaki implants forcibly welded to its spine."
  - line: 197
    type: narration
    text: "It reared, throat swelling."
  - line: 198
    type: narration
    text: "Not acid."
  - line: 199
    type: narration
    text: "A beam of corrupted luminescence ripped toward Lyra—a mimicry of the Spire’s own power, twisted and vile."
  - line: 200
    type: narration
    text: "Mika lunged, shield-first."
  - line: 201
    type: narration
    text: "The blast hammered her back, cracking her kinetic field like glass."
  - line: 202
    type: narration
    text: "She skidded across wet stone, gasping."
  - line: 203
    type: narration
    text: "Oreck intercepted the Alpha’s follow-up strike."
  - line: 204
    type: narration
    text: "His cleaver met its descending claw."
  - line: 205
    type: narration
    text: "Metal screamed."
  - line: 206
    type: narration
    text: "Chroniton sparks showered the water."
  - line: 207
    type: narration
    text: "Halvar and Torren flanked the beast, blades useless against its thick plates."
  - line: 208
    type: narration
    text: "Jorik peppered its eyes, buying seconds."
  - line: 209
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s focus never wavered from the Spire."
  - line: 210
    type: narration
    text: "Zaron’s power intensified."
  - line: 211
    type: narration
    text: "Azure light coiled around the obsidian needle, peeling back the violet corruption strand by agonizing strand."
  - line: 212
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra’s hands trembled as her filaments fused deeper into the resonance field."
  - line: 213
    type: narration
    text: "\"Almost… synced!\" The Alpha screeched."
  - line: 214
    type: narration
    text: "Its tail whipped, sending Torren crashing into a crumbling wall."
  - line: 215
    type: narration
    text: "Halvar leapt atop its back, dagger stabbing for implant seams."
  - line: 216
    type: narration
    text: "Useless."
  - line: 217
    type: narration
    text: "The beast bucked, flinging him into dark water."
  - line: 218
    type: narration
    text: "Mika staggered upright, shock-lance spitting unstable energy."
  - line: 219
    type: narration
    text: "\"Geralt!"
  - line: 220
    type: narration
    text: "We need—\"."
  - line: 221
    type: narration
    text: "The Luminaire flared again."
  - line: 222
    type: narration
    text: "Brighter."
  - line: 223
    type: narration
    text: "Cleaner."
  - line: 224
    type: narration
    text: "The Alpha recoiled, its corrupted light beam sputtering."
  - line: 225
    type: narration
    text: "Oreck seized the moment."
  - line: 226
    type: narration
    text: "His cleaver plunged into the beast’s neck joint."
  - line: 227
    type: narration
    text: "Not flesh."
  - line: 228
    type: narration
    text: "The chroniton blade targeted the pulsing Anunnaki implant grafted to its spine."
  - line: 229
    type: narration
    text: "Melted wiring exploded outward."
  - line: 230
    type: narration
    text: "The Alpha shrieked, collapsing."
  - line: 231
    type: narration
    text: "Silence fell."
  - line: 232
    type: narration
    text: "Only the drip of water and the Luminaire’s pure, strengthening hum remained."
  - line: 233
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra withdrew her filaments, swaying."
  - line: 234
    type: narration
    text: "\"Anchor stabilized… for now.\" The violet veins were faded ghosts."
  - line: 235
    type: narration
    text: "But beneath the obsidian spire, the water still churned."
  - line: 236
    type: narration
    text: "Something deeper than drakes stirred."
  - line: 237
    type: narration
    text: "The descent wasn’t over."
  - line: 238
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt turned toward the Stair’s shadowed continuation."
  - line: 239
    type: narration
    text: "\"Move.\" Integration had bought them time."
  - line: 240
    type: narration
    text: "The Darkness ahead?"
  - line: 241
    type: narration
    text: "That was revelation’s price."
  - line: 243
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 245
    type: internal_monologue
    text: "\"*The Cavern of Nammus - Atmospheric Entry*\""
  - line: 247
    type: narration
    text: "The Stair swallowed them whole."
  - line: 248
    type: narration
    text: "Each downward step crushed Geralt’s shoulders tighter."
  - line: 249
    type: narration
    text: "Condensation wept from fused basalt walls, slick beneath scaled boots."
  - line: 250
    type: narration
    text: "Air thickened—metal-tanged humidity pressing like drowned lungs."
  - line: 251
    type: narration
    text: "No desert wind dared trespass here."
  - line: 252
    type: narration
    text: "Only the Spire’s ghost-light bled upward, painting jagged silhouettes that danced with each flicker."
  - line: 253
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaire Corvin gasped behind Geralt."
  - line: 254
    type: narration
    text: "A choked sound."
  - line: 255
    type: narration
    text: "Then retching."
  - line: 256
    type: narration
    text: "Pressure sickness."
  - line: 257
    type: narration
    text: "The Luminaire’s buried song wasn’t heard—*felt*."
  - line: 258
    type: narration
    text: "It vibrated ribcages, warping inner ears."
  - line: 259
    type: narration
    text: "Equilibrium shattered."
  - line: 260
    type: narration
    text: "Shieldbearer Jax stumbled sideways, helmet amplifying the dissonance into a skull-drilling whine."
  - line: 261
    type: narration
    text: "Tinnitus screamed."
  - line: 262
    type: narration
    text: "Vertigo pulled."
  - line: 263
    type: narration
    text: "Below, the shaft breathed—a subsonic groan resonating through stone and bone alike."
  - line: 264
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s dragonmail flared azure, Zaron’s will anchoring him against the pull. *One step lower and your stomach drops—the resonance isn’t sound, it’s gravity bending.* He gripped Corvin’s pauldron, hauling him upright against the trembling wall."
  - line: 265
    type: narration
    text: "Sweat carved trails through grime on pale faces."
  - line: 266
    type: narration
    text: "Silence."
  - line: 267
    type: narration
    text: "Only the drip."
  - line: 268
    type: narration
    text: "And the hum."
  - line: 270
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 272
    type: internal_monologue
    text: "\"*Resonant Chamber - Cavern One*\""
  - line: 274
    type: narration
    text: "The shaft opened."
  - line: 275
    type: narration
    text: "A cathedral-sized dome unfolded—stalactites hung like shattered chandeliers, wrapped in crystalline filaments humming with trapped resonance."
  - line: 276
    type: narration
    text: "Water pooled ankle-deep, hiding razor-edged mineral ridges."
  - line: 277
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt motioned: halt."
  - line: 278
    type: narration
    text: "Sound here wasn't trust."
  - line: 279
    type: narration
    text: "Corporal Vess’s whisper echoed back seconds later—*\"Watch the—\"*—overlapping her own caution."
  - line: 280
    type: narration
    text: "Auditory ghosts."
  - line: 281
    type: narration
    text: "Hallucinations whispered commands Mika never gave."
  - line: 282
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaire Ren spun, shock-lance raised toward empty darkness."
  - line: 283
    type: narration
    text: "\"Who’s there?\" Oreck’s amber gaze scanned the vaulted ceiling."
  - line: 284
    type: narration
    text: "Translucent shapes clung there—blind, choral fauna, spider-limbed and thin as paper."
  - line: 285
    type: narration
    text: "Harmonic pulses rippled across their bodies."
  - line: 286
    type: narration
    text: "A dropped power-cell clanged."
  - line: 287
    type: narration
    text: "Instantly, the creatures *stirred*."
  - line: 288
    type: narration
    text: "Legs unfolding in eerie silence."
  - line: 289
    type: narration
    text: "They flowed down stalactites like liquid shadow, drawn to the sound’s epicenter."
  - line: 290
    type: narration
    text: "Mika’s hand signal was sharp: *Absolute silence.* Survival demanded it."
  - line: 291
    type: narration
    text: "Move slow."
  - line: 292
    type: narration
    text: "Step careful."
  - line: 293
    type: narration
    text: "Trust nothing your ears say."
  - line: 294
    type: narration
    text: "The fauna settled."
  - line: 295
    type: narration
    text: "Waiting."
  - line: 296
    type: narration
    text: "Every scrape of boot, every rasp of breath, risked awakening the choir."
  - line: 298
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 300
    type: internal_monologue
    text: "\"*Erosion Galleries - Cavern Two*\""
  - line: 302
    type: narration
    text: "Basalt yielded to fossilized roots—massive, petrified veins from the swamp above."
  - line: 303
    type: narration
    text: "Water surged without warning, thigh-high torrents roaring through twisting tunnels."
  - line: 304
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaires braced against carved walls slick with millennia of scum."
  - line: 305
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra’s rig flashed methane warnings: 82% saturation."
  - line: 306
    type: narration
    text: "One spark."
  - line: 307
    type: narration
    text: "One misfiring shield."
  - line: 308
    type: narration
    text: "Annihilation."
  - line: 309
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt pressed forward, Zaron’s resonance mapping safe paths through labyrinthine gloom."
  - line: 310
    type: narration
    text: "Torren argued with Halvar, voice tight."
  - line: 311
    type: narration
    text: "\"We entered this gallery *minutes* ago!\" Halvar rasped back, \"Hours!"
  - line: 312
    type: narration
    text: "Feel this ache?\" Temporal drift."
  - line: 313
    type: narration
    text: "Humidity and void resonance stretched seconds into subjective eternities."
  - line: 314
    type: narration
    text: "Compasses spun wildly."
  - line: 315
    type: narration
    text: "Maps dissolved into madness."
  - line: 316
    type: narration
    text: "Navigation became faith."
  - line: 317
    type: narration
    text: "Trust Geralt’s armored back cutting through the reeking dark."
  - line: 318
    type: narration
    text: "Trust Oreck’s chroniton arrows flaring green at intersections."
  - line: 319
    type: narration
    text: "Trust nothing else."
  - line: 320
    type: narration
    text: "Especially not time."
  - line: 322
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 324
    type: internal_monologue
    text: "\"*Heart Chamber - Cavern Three*\""
  - line: 326
    type: narration
    text: "Light stabbed their eyes."
  - line: 327
    type: narration
    text: "The obsidian Void Spire plunged downward into the Lucid Storm—an underground lake burning with captured energy, teal and blinding."
  - line: 328
    type: narration
    text: "Static crackled across Geralt’s vambrace, shorting displays."
  - line: 329
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaire shields flickered, failing."
  - line: 330
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra cursed as her medicae rig sparked, injectors dropping inert."
  - line: 331
    type: narration
    text: "Bioluminescent horrors—eel-things woven from lightning—snaked through the water, drawn to kinetic fields."
  - line: 332
    type: narration
    text: "Mika glanced left."
  - line: 333
    type: narration
    text: "Torren’s reflection shimmered on the lake surface—not his scarred face, but a sneering warlord draped in Anunnaki sigils."
  - line: 334
    type: narration
    text: "Halvar recoiled from his own reflection: a skeletal husk bleeding shadow."
  - line: 335
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt saw Zaren’s dragon form fractured, scales edged in violet rot."
  - line: 336
    type: narration
    text: "The Luminaire’s light didn’t illuminate."
  - line: 337
    type: narration
    text: "It judged."
  - line: 339
    type: narration
    text: "Oreck moved first."
  - line: 340
    type: narration
    text: "Boots struck water—and the storm ignited."
  - line: 341
    type: narration
    text: "Arcs of raw electricity spiderwebbed outward, seeking conduits."
  - line: 342
    type: narration
    text: "Gear sparked."
  - line: 343
    type: narration
    text: "Shields died."
  - line: 344
    type: narration
    text: "Torren screamed as an eel-thing latched onto his greave, bioelectricity seizing his muscles."
  - line: 345
    type: narration
    text: "Halvar hacked it free, blade sizzling."
  - line: 346
    type: narration
    text: "Mika’s reflection leered: *Weakness costs lives*."
  - line: 347
    type: narration
    text: "She fired her shock-lance point-blank into the water."
  - line: 348
    type: narration
    text: "Mist rose, stinging ozone."
  - line: 349
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt waded deeper, Zaron’s spirit warring with the storm’s pull."
  - line: 350
    type: narration
    text: "Azure scales flared brighter, repelling arcs."
  - line: 351
    type: narration
    text: "But the reflections... they whispered."
  - line: 352
    type: narration
    text: "Zaren’s dragon-shadow coiled in the ripples: *Accept her power."
  - line: 353
    type: narration
    text: "Let them burn.* Truth’s weight crushed his ribs."
  - line: 354
    type: narration
    text: "Each step sank him deeper into liquid light."
  - line: 356
    type: narration
    text: "Lyra stumbled, rig sputtering."
  - line: 357
    type: narration
    text: "\"Resonance overload!"
  - line: 358
    type: narration
    text: "Gear’s failing!\" Her own reflection showed her hands decayed, bones protruding—a healer’s failure made flesh."
  - line: 359
    type: narration
    text: "The Luminaire pulsed."
  - line: 360
    type: narration
    text: "Not a beacon."
  - line: 361
    type: narration
    text: "A predator."
  - line: 362
    type: narration
    text: "It sensed Geralt’s proximity."
  - line: 363
    type: narration
    text: "The lake boiled."
  - line: 364
    type: narration
    text: "Energy tendrils lashed, wrapping his legs."
  - line: 365
    type: narration
    text: "Zaron roared within him, a sound swallowed by static."
  - line: 366
    type: narration
    text: "Mika fought beside him, shieldless, lance spearing eel-things."
  - line: 367
    type: narration
    text: "Torren dragged Halvar from the water, both convulsing."
  - line: 368
    type: narration
    text: "Then came the voice—not sound, but thought etching bone:"
  - line: 370
    type: internal_monologue
    text: "\"*ASCEND OR ANCHOR.*\""
  - line: 371
    type: narration
    text: "Images flooded Geralt’s mind: Oreck disintegrating."
  - line: 372
    type: narration
    text: "Mika dissolving into light."
  - line: 373
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaires vaporized as raw power surged through him—dragon wings unfurling against the void."
  - line: 374
    type: narration
    text: "The Luminaire’s core glowed hungrily behind tangled roots."
  - line: 375
    type: narration
    text: "Sacrifice them."
  - line: 376
    type: narration
    text: "Become its master."
  - line: 377
    type: narration
    text: "Silence the storm."
  - line: 378
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt’s gauntlet trembled."
  - line: 379
    type: narration
    text: "Beneath the water, the storm gathered strength."
  - line: 381
    type: scene_header
    text: "---"
  - line: 383
    type: narration
    text: "The cracked sandstone stairs vanished beneath ankle-deep water slick with condensation."
  - line: 384
    type: narration
    text: "Each step echoed too loud, too soon—a drumbeat swallowed by damp stone."
  - line: 385
    type: narration
    text: "Geralt led, boots sinking into unseen silt."
  - line: 386
    type: narration
    text: "Above, the ceiling wept mineral tears that hissed against heated armor seals."
  - line: 387
    type: narration
    text: "Below, the Void Spire’s ghost-light bled upward, painting the shaft walls into jagged, shifting silhouettes."
  - line: 388
    type: narration
    text: "Legionnaire Bren gasped behind him—a wet, choked sound."
  - line: 389
    type: narration
    text: "Then retching."
  - line: 390
    type: narration
    text: "Pressure sickness."
  - line: 391
    type: narration
